{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e10-scene-06",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "三次技术犯规本场比赛取消  (Three Technical Fouls Cancel the Match)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Two games ahead in Hong Kong, Chun Yuqiao deliberately spins the foosball rods three times to void the match so the proud ad tycoon saves face—provoking Xingtian's longtime sponsor next door into pledging a higher bid for Twelve Singers. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "手柄旋转三百六以上，技术犯规。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "按规则这球得重新来。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "三次技术犯规，本场比赛取消。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我觉着非常不妥，演技浮夸。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "把侯总的账结了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "谢你什么？谢你给我机会，帮你家公司赚钱吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我刚打球你不是看了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "上大学的时候，为了练习做节目。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "举办了一届校际桌式足球比赛。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "然后就摸清了规则，技战术练了练。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "学校几个球友打不过我，嫌没劲。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "这联赛就没有再举办过第二届。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "手柄旋转三百六以上，技术犯规。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Spinning the handle past three hundred sixty degrees is a technical foul.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "按规则这球得重新来。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Under tournament rules, this ball has to be replayed.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "三次技术犯规，本场比赛取消。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Three technical fouls — this match is officially canceled.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我觉着非常不妥，演技浮夸。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I thought throwing the game looked clumsy — the acting was way over the top.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "把侯总的账结了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Please settle the gentleman's tab on our way out.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "谢你什么？谢你给我机会，帮你家公司赚钱吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you for what? For giving me the chance to make money for your family's company?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我刚打球你不是看了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Didn't you just watch me play a moment ago?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "上大学的时候，为了练习做节目。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Back in university, I wanted practice organizing a live program.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "举办了一届校际桌式足球比赛。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'So I put together an intercollegiate table-football tournament.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "然后就摸清了规则，技战术练了练。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then I figured out all the rules and practiced the techniques and tactics.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "学校几个球友打不过我，嫌没劲。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'None of the campus players could beat me, so they complained it wasn't fun.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "这联赛就没有再举办过第二届。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And that league never held a second tournament again.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "手柄旋转三百六以上，技术犯规。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "按规则这球得重新来。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "三次技术犯规，本场比赛取消。",
      "gap": 0.5
